WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:05.860
The SCP Foundation’s hallowed halls have
been the site of many great and puzzling mysteries.

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:11.680
Among them being, who was the true creator
of SCP-173, the neck-snapping Sculpture?

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:15.420
What are the secrets that Dr. Alto Clef is
keeping about his past?

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:18.980
Who are the true seven children of the Scarlet
King?

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:23.569
Who was SCP-106, the Old Man, before he got
all nasty?

00:00:23.569 --> 00:00:32.160
And of course, what is the true nature and
origin of SCP-096 - The violent, terrifying,

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:34.350
and incredibly withdrawn Shy Guy?

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:39.250
It’s a question so great that we knew even
our experts here at SCP Explained couldn’t

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:40.500
take on the mission alone.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:45.929
That’s why we pooled the resources of you,
the loyal viewers of SCP Explained, to find

00:00:45.929 --> 00:00:47.000
the answer.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.370
We made a community post asking for your personal
theories on how the Shy Guy came to be, and

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:57.449
you didn’t disappoint, sending in a cavalcade
of curious conjecture that we just can’t

00:00:57.449 --> 00:00:58.840
wait to explore.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:02.390
So let’s hop right in and see what all of
you had to say!

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:03.879
Here is PuffyShade’s theory:

00:01:03.879 --> 00:01:07.180
“He was a lost British D-class named Martin
McGregor.

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:13.340
On a risky experiment in Columbia regarding
SCP-1290, a D-class prisoner was teleported

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:17.660
to an unknown mountainous location after a
malfunction in the device.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:22.320
He stayed there for 37 hours before dying
of his bullet wounds from being shot by foreign

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:23.340
soldiers.

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:28.390
Wherever the D-class was teleported to was
a foreign country not welcome to outsiders.

00:01:28.390 --> 00:01:32.610
As we all know, there have been some SCPs
that have escaped the grasp of the foundation.

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:37.280
The foundation has located them, but never
been able to see or capture them.

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:41.950
Continuing with the story, it is speculated
that one of these entities that is still undiscovered

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:44.250
had the power of necromancy.

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:49.030
They brought the D-class back to the mortal
world, but in an immortal form.

00:01:49.030 --> 00:01:51.430
To terrorize humanity forever.

00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:56.650
The entity brings humans back to life as supernatural
beings, their powers being determined by their

00:01:56.650 --> 00:01:58.390
former personality.

00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:03.720
The resurrected D-class was always shy, self
conscious of his unattractive face.

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:08.170
As you can probably guess, this resulted in
the birth of our good old friend,

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:09.450
Shy Guy.”

00:02:09.450 --> 00:02:14.100
Certainly a fascinating direction to go, with
a basis in recorded anomalous activity.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:19.620
And much like a few other anomalies originating
from D-Class personnel, such as SCP-2419,

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:25.810
the Laughing Men, and SCP-4973, the Dead Men
Walking, it would feel oddly satisfying to

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:31.250
see another one of the Foundation’s greatest
mistakes become one of the gravest threats.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.190
Here is DiamondStar Lemon’s theory:

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:37.750
“The Shy Guy was Andrew Irvine, one of 2
mountaineers that went missing who were part

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:42.530
of the British expedition that was sent to
reach the top of Mount Everest in 1924.

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:47.569
While Andrew and his friend George Mallory
were heading for camp 5 , they encountered

00:02:47.569 --> 00:02:50.660
SCP-1529 at different intervals.

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:55.760
Since Mallory's body was eventually found
in 1999 this tells us that Irvine also encountered

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:57.400
1529.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:03.010
Irvine constantly rejected 1529's offers and
eventually developed a defense mechanism where

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:07.840
he gets aggressive and attacks SCP-1529, in
return

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:13.430
1529 prolonged his life by years to make him
suffer every single minute.

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:18.650
His skin turned white due to constant exposure
to the sun and he took off all of his clothes

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:20.290
due to hypothermia.

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:24.440
This is confirmed because Mallory's body was
just as white as Irvine and a letter he sent

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:30.510
to his family says that Andrew became very
shy and barely speaks and he eventually disappears.

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:35.640
Mallory then encounters 1529 and punches him
in the face and then Mallory falls unconscious

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:37.310
leading to his death.

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:41.990
Meanwhile Irvine loses his sanity and has
his body disfigured and his hands developed

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.890
claws for better climbing.”

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:49.590
This is another popular theory which has its
roots in pre-existing anomalous knowledge.

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:54.819
The horrific tortures by SCP-1529, the Mountain
King, against Andrew Irvine is believed by

00:03:54.819 --> 00:03:57.670
many to be the root of the Shy Guy’s creation.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:02.520
Of course, we can’t know for sure, but some
compelling evidence undeniably points in this

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:04.430
intriguing direction.

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.420
Here is #1 Try Hard’s Theory:

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:10.400
“I think he was one of the subjects in the
Russian Sleep Experiment that escaped and

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:15.560
ran into the Siberian mountains, became aware
of the monstrosity he had become, and became

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:17.759
violently self conscious.”

00:04:17.759 --> 00:04:23.569
This is a strange and creative theory, wrapping
096 in with the lore of the legendary Russian

00:04:23.569 --> 00:04:25.180
Sleep Experiment.

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:30.580
Russia does have its fair share of snowy mountain
ranges, and the experiment did turn its unfortunate

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:32.969
subjects into horrifying monsters.

00:04:32.969 --> 00:04:37.900
But the nature of these monsters did differ
significantly from the Shy Guy - showing higher

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:42.009
intelligence, but far less durability against
physical trauma.

00:04:42.009 --> 00:04:43.560
Here is Avery Spencer’s theory:

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:48.490
“I have wondered if perhaps he was part
of an almost Dyatlov Pass incident and was

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:50.189
the sole survivor.

00:04:50.189 --> 00:04:53.210
Being in such a position he was forced to
eat his comrades.

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:57.909
He then took on almost wendigo aspects, but
instead of the blood thirsty feelings most

00:04:57.909 --> 00:05:03.009
got he became so ashamed of what he did he
can no longer tolerate someone looking at

00:05:03.009 --> 00:05:04.009
him.”

00:05:04.009 --> 00:05:09.159
This is another incredibly interesting theory
that has its basis in both Russian legend

00:05:09.159 --> 00:05:10.479
and real life history.

00:05:10.479 --> 00:05:14.900
There have been a number of events in the
snowy mountains of Russia, much like the Dyatlov

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:18.819
Pass Incident, which have left high-altitude
tragedies in their wake.

00:05:18.819 --> 00:05:22.820
One of these, traumatizing its victim to the
point of turning them into an anomalous creature

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:27.370
like SCP-096 definitely doesn’t seem out
of the question.

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:29.039
Here is Kyreikal’s theory:

00:05:29.039 --> 00:05:31.599
“Shy Guy has no face.

00:05:31.599 --> 00:05:33.339
His face does not exist.

00:05:33.339 --> 00:05:38.349
Not in the sense that its just smooth skin,
the face is actually nothing.

00:05:38.349 --> 00:05:42.699
He is a body and mind directly attached to
a pattern screamer.

00:05:42.699 --> 00:05:45.759
Humans expect humanoid shaped creatures to
have a face.

00:05:45.759 --> 00:05:50.710
Thus when someone sees his "face" the screamer
takes over and destroys that person so it

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:52.129
can stop existing.

00:05:52.129 --> 00:05:57.210
His body has changed over the years to facilitate
eliminating people who see the "face" more

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:58.639
effectively.

00:05:58.639 --> 00:06:04.189
This is why he wants to dissappear in the
desire camera, finish being nothing so people

00:06:04.189 --> 00:06:06.479
stop filling in his face.

00:06:06.479 --> 00:06:11.169
A way it could have happened is an incomplete
encounter with 3930.

00:06:11.169 --> 00:06:16.350
The one who became the shy guy leaned in and
just his face ceased to exist.

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:20.879
Though he probably would have already needed
some anomalous traits to survive that.”

00:06:20.879 --> 00:06:26.139
This is another extremely original and interesting
theory based in pre-existing anomalies.

00:06:26.139 --> 00:06:31.759
Of course, there’s no real way to prove
that SCP-096’s face isn’t a pattern screamer,

00:06:31.759 --> 00:06:37.009
given that to look upon it is to court death,
so we may just need to take your word on this

00:06:37.009 --> 00:06:38.009
one…

00:06:38.009 --> 00:06:39.509
Here is Lacintag’s theory:

00:06:39.509 --> 00:06:44.830
“Perhaps 096 is an alien from a planet or
dimension that's completely dark, where being

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:48.680
seen is a death sentence because of the local
anomalous fauna.

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:51.479
He somehow wound up in our universe.

00:06:51.479 --> 00:06:56.339
Perhaps 096 is cursed that whoever sees him
will eventually transform into something much

00:06:56.339 --> 00:06:59.210
worse, or become a portal into a dark dimension.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:04.479
And he does us all a favor by eliminating
these people before that can happen.”

00:07:04.479 --> 00:07:09.819
Another two extremely interesting theories,
both of which could potentially hold water.

00:07:09.819 --> 00:07:15.629
They seem consistent with the fact that SCP-096
takes no pleasure in the killing of its victims,

00:07:15.629 --> 00:07:20.360
it only seems to be doing it out of the sense
that it feels compelled into action.

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:22.110
Here is Chill Me’s theory:

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:26.669
“He could be the physical embodiment of
the feeling of body dysmorphia.”

00:07:26.669 --> 00:07:32.810
Another very valid theory, given SCP-096’s
general temperament and caustic reactions

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:35.189
to being perceived in any way.

00:07:35.189 --> 00:07:36.969
Here is Renan Roman’s theory:

00:07:36.969 --> 00:07:40.659
“What would happen if Dr Bright looked at
scp 096's face?

00:07:40.659 --> 00:07:45.210
I mean, his host would certainly be killed,
but what would happen as soon as Dr Bright

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:46.629
picks another host?

00:07:46.629 --> 00:07:52.120
Would scp 096 instantaneously charge at the
new host and kill it as well?”

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:56.410
An interesting theory, and one that we’ve
explored ourselves on videos concerning Dr.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:57.449
Bright before.

00:07:57.449 --> 00:08:01.830
It’s another good reason that this particular
scenario should be placed on the “Dr. Bright

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:03.319
is Not Allowed” list.

00:08:03.319 --> 00:08:08.569
Though even though Dr. Bright does occasionally
beg for death, this is one horrifying recursive

00:08:08.569 --> 00:08:12.300
fate that even Jack himself probably wouldn’t
enjoy.

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.860
Here is Hon Guy’s theory:

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:18.179
“From what I heard there are two theories,
one was the he was a mountaineer that survived

00:08:18.179 --> 00:08:22.110
an encounter with the king of the mountain
and had to adapt to the mountain to survive

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:27.099
both from him and the mountain itself or he’s
actually one of the children of the Scarlet

00:08:27.099 --> 00:08:28.099
King.”

00:08:28.099 --> 00:08:32.190
While we’ve covered the Mountain King theory,
this Scarlet King theory is all new.

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:36.750
Could SCP-096 be a child of the terrifying
Scarlet King?

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:42.219
He’s certainly destructive, but perhaps
he lacks the true knowing malice - the sadism

00:08:42.219 --> 00:08:45.800
- that’d make that big, red, armored lunatic
proud.

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:49.610
He certainly doesn’t have the abject hatred
of a 682.

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:50.960
Here is Clawed Cat’s theory:

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:55.970
“I wouldn't be surprised if he was a species
and came to be that way as it is perfectly

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:56.970
hidden.

00:08:56.970 --> 00:09:01.570
They blend in with the snow, and if anyone
saw its face to know it was there, they couldn’t

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:03.480
document it for obvious reasons.”

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:07.120
This is an interesting and terrifying concept.

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:09.740
A whole species of Shy Guys.

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:14.490
This is another good reason to ardently fight
against climate change - If all the snow melts,

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:18.240
there’ll be nowhere for them to hide anymore…

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:19.490
Here is Dan Wolf’s theory:

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:24.300
“The idea of "if a tree falls and no one
is around to hear it..." is his origin.

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:30.870
He is the physical manifestation of the energy
of all the things unseen, the sound of a falling

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:36.430
tree, the transparent skin of fish in the
abyssal zone, development on Halflife 3.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:40.420
All these things exist but they do so UNSEEN.

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:46.680
SHY is physical manifestation of that metaphysical
energy, he didn't exist until he was seen

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:48.980
thus he came to be.

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:54.100
Existing is painful to him so he kills anyone
who sees his face, the thing we as humans

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:59.480
use to identify one another, in a hope to
be unrecognized and unknown to eventually

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:01.279
no longer exists.”

00:10:01.279 --> 00:10:03.769
This is a fascinating theory.

00:10:03.769 --> 00:10:09.250
Our one question is how he could ever be seen
if, by definition, he is an avatar of the

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.250
unseen?

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:13.240
What would cause these lapses in non-existence?

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:17.579
It raises an interesting metaphysical quandary
in and of itself…

00:10:17.579 --> 00:10:19.199
Here is Jonathan Collier’s theory:

00:10:19.199 --> 00:10:24.149
“The Shy Guy is a creation of the Plague
Doctor, who engineered him in the French Alps.

00:10:24.149 --> 00:10:29.230
He began as a human, but the doctor's process
mutated him into his current form.

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:33.399
He designed him to destroy the pestilence,
but he was infected by it somewhere in the

00:10:33.399 --> 00:10:34.399
process.

00:10:34.399 --> 00:10:38.890
This means that whenever someone sees his
face, they catch the pestilence.

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:43.529
His programming can't allow this, so he is
forced to destroy whoever sees him.

00:10:43.529 --> 00:10:48.050
The doctor's programming was incomplete when
he was corrupted, so he only hunts those that

00:10:48.050 --> 00:10:53.639
he has infected with the pestilence, not all
that the Plague Doctor deems infected.

00:10:53.639 --> 00:10:58.220
His indestructible form is a combination of
the Plague Doctor's tinkering and treatments

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:03.400
as well as the doctor potentially incorporating
DNA from other anomalous creatures, such as

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:07.480
682, which did visit France in Lord Blackwood's
tales.

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:12.629
The doctor likely kept the DNA in reserve
for his ultimate device to destroy the pestilence,

00:11:12.629 --> 00:11:16.820
however it failed and led to him releasing
the Shy Guy to roam the mountains, traveling

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:20.500
eventually from the Alps to the Himalayas
where he was discovered.

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:24.980
The creature cries as it kills it's victims
because of it's human beginnings, and it's

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:30.220
apparent anxiety is likely the lingering emotion
it felt before it was transformed, leading

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:33.430
to it being repeated for the rest of it's
existence.”

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:37.899
We love the Plague Doctor here at SCP Explained,
so we’re always happy to consider fun potential

00:11:37.899 --> 00:11:41.880
crossovers featuring him with some of our
other favorite anomalies.

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:47.019
The one thing working against this theory
is that 096 is an uncharacteristically effective

00:11:47.019 --> 00:11:52.329
creation for the Plague Doctor’s standards,
most of which are janky, disfigured zombies.

00:11:52.329 --> 00:11:54.250
Sorry, 049.

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:55.800
Here is Devon Linder’s theory:

00:11:55.800 --> 00:12:01.470
“I always felt like 096 was possessed by
an evil spirit that lives in the frost, essentially

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:03.620
the original native story of a wendigo.

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:08.820
It just all makes sense, deformities and strength,
lives in the cold, hunts and kills people.

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:12.769
I don’t know if there’s anything about
looking at a wendigo in the original stories

00:12:12.769 --> 00:12:13.769
though.”

00:12:13.769 --> 00:12:19.410
The Algonquin myth of the Wendigo certainly
does have some similarities to SCP-096, however,

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:26.161
it has a little more in common with another
anomaly - SCP-323, the Wendigo Skull, which

00:12:26.161 --> 00:12:30.519
forces its wearers into spontaneous acts of
violence and cannibalism.

00:12:30.519 --> 00:12:36.970
Though if ever 096 found itself wearing the
Wendigo Skull, we’d all be in terrible trouble…

00:12:36.970 --> 00:12:39.100
Here is EpicKitty 101’s theory:

00:12:39.100 --> 00:12:42.339
“Not really a theory, it's just what I want
it to be.

00:12:42.339 --> 00:12:46.390
I believe that 096’s actions are derived
from trauma.

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:50.870
It could very well be a species and might
be a different version, like albino so whenever

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:56.329
someone looks at its face it feels as though
that person was so inconvenienced by its looks

00:12:56.329 --> 00:13:00.020
it wants to kill them because he thinks they
hate him now.

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:03.310
He believes he isn't good enough for anyone's
standards.”

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:05.760
We can all relate to that feeling now and
then.

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:11.680
And the hysteric crying and wailing of SCP-096
undeniably suggests a level of psychological

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:12.680
trauma.

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:16.980
One thing we know for sure: It definitely
inflicts trauma on the rest of us.

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:19.000
Here is Lemon Demon Danganronpa’s theory:

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:25.060
“Hear me out: When Day Breaks was actually
a primitive event, and the Shy Guy was the

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:26.060
result.

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:30.209
Without any people to go around for the next
several millennia, The Shy Guy grew fond of

00:13:30.209 --> 00:13:36.269
the lack of company, ultimately turning him
into the person-or monster-he is today.”

00:13:36.269 --> 00:13:41.240
This is a fascinating one, however, there
is some pre-existing evidence - such as the

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:46.720
tale Unexpected Light, which we’ve covered
in a video on this channel - that suggest

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:50.879
SCP-096 survived into the reign of SCP-001
When Day Breaks.

00:13:50.879 --> 00:13:55.370
Though sadly, according to that tale, he didn’t
survive beyond it.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:56.819
Here is Andrew Colon’s theory:

00:13:56.819 --> 00:14:01.350
“I have a theory that he was born with some
deformities and super strength and was mocked

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:02.350
for it.

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:05.250
As he grew older the deformities grew more
noticeable.

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:10.180
So maybe the years of trauma and abuse or
what not have caused him to self isolate and

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:13.290
attack violently against anyone who sees him.”

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:19.490
This definitely reflects the internality that
many people believe SCP-096 has: A frightened,

00:14:19.490 --> 00:14:24.480
insecure creature, spiting its own creation
and anyone unfortunate enough to look upon

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:25.480
it.

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:28.629
Though we’ll never really know how exactly
it got there…

00:14:28.629 --> 00:14:30.790
Here is Stripeysox 101’s theory:

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:36.380
“He could have been one of the SCP-1000
instances but born hairless and unable to

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:38.779
think, so was abandoned by its parents.”

00:14:38.779 --> 00:14:44.249
Another good cross-anomaly connection, however,
096 is significantly more durable than any

00:14:44.249 --> 00:14:49.750
member of SCP-1000, as well as having far
more freakish proportions, so it’s unlikely

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:53.730
to have any real relation to this advanced
species of apes.

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:55.209
Here is Blue Iblis’ theory:

00:14:55.209 --> 00:15:00.829
“Well based on his height, his reaction
to his face being seen, and how quick he is...

00:15:00.829 --> 00:15:03.930
SCP-096 is literally just an IRL Enderman.

00:15:03.930 --> 00:15:07.939
They're both tall, they're both able to move
quickly, and become instantly pissed if you

00:15:07.939 --> 00:15:09.730
look at their face/eyes.

00:15:09.730 --> 00:15:15.079
This probably means 096 is maaaybe from another
dimension, but its just a theory.”

00:15:15.079 --> 00:15:20.000
We might dismiss a potential Minecraft influence
out of hand, were it not for the existence

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:26.300
of SCP-4335, also known as A Welt In The Crucible,
an evil Minecraft monster.

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:30.199
However, this monster was actually the one
responsible for the Ender Men in Minecraft

00:15:30.199 --> 00:15:35.699
due to a Foundation-inspired patch, sadly
invalidating this theory.

00:15:35.699 --> 00:15:37.420
Here is James Bevan’s theory:

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:42.639
“My theory is that the Shy Guy is a demon
summoned by a cult that dwelled in the mountains.

00:15:42.639 --> 00:15:46.569
They hoped to control him, but were unaware
that the entity reacts violently whenever

00:15:46.569 --> 00:15:49.709
anyone sees its face and all met a grisly
death.”

00:15:49.709 --> 00:15:53.680
SCP-096 is undeniably rather…

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:57.060
Demonic, so we couldn’t argue with this
theory on that front.

00:15:57.060 --> 00:16:01.519
It’s also very likely that any cult who
unwittingly summoned him, without the knowledge

00:16:01.519 --> 00:16:07.240
of his primary anomalous effect, would meet
a truly gruesome death at his claws and teeth,

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:09.999
so you may be on to something here, James.

00:16:09.999 --> 00:16:11.790
Here is Harrison O’Leary’s theory:

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:16.100
“Well, when he left the mushroom kingdom,
he obviously lost his mask and clothes.”

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:22.819
The idea that the Shy Guy is literally, well,
a Shy Guy, is certainly an intriguing one

00:16:22.819 --> 00:16:28.290
- though how 096’s long, gangly body could
fit into those tiny, compact outfits is an

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:29.610
open question.

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:34.100
If only Researcher Mario and Researcher Luigi
would take some time off of their extremely

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:42.129
busy schedules to help us out with this one…

00:16:42.129 --> 00:16:43.670
Here is Roninski’s theory:

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:48.899
“He was a very handsome man who was experimented
on, and now goes into violent fits of rage

00:16:48.899 --> 00:16:52.009
when people look at his now disfigured face.”

00:16:52.009 --> 00:16:53.009
Hmm.

00:16:53.009 --> 00:16:59.129
Is it just us, or is the idea of a strangely
handsome SCP-096 somehow even more disturbing

00:16:59.129 --> 00:17:01.089
than the one we already have?

00:17:01.089 --> 00:17:02.820
Just feels so unnatural…

00:17:02.820 --> 00:17:05.650
Which of these wild theories do you think
was your favorite?

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:08.060
Do you have a stunning revelation we haven’t
covered here?

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:10.410
Feel free to let us know down in the comments.

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:15.240
And of course, keep an eye on our community
tab for fun new questions if you too want

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:18.950
the chance to be featured in a video like
this in the future!

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:27.300
Now go check out “SCP-096 Shy Guy ESCAPE
- Incident 096-1-A Containment Breach” and

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:29.420
“SCP-096 - Look at a Picture of Shy Guy
in Space?

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:34.220
The Shy Guy Questions and Theories” for
more of this singularly enigmatic anomalous

00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:34.950
introvert!

